EnduroSat (https://www.endurosat.com/):

    This fork of libcsp is maintained by the EnduroSat team. We thank the original authors of the
    project for their work and we are happy to use and contribute to this project.

    Why did we fork libcsp instead of contributing directly?
    --------------------------------------------------------
    As a fast-paced space company, we need to be able to move quickly and adapt to
    changing requirements. Forking was the best way to achieve this, however we are
    committed to keeping the core protocol intact and only make changes to the
    surrounding implementation where it makes sense for us as a company. Even though
    there are not significant changes in our forked repository for the moment, we expect this to
    change in the future as we expand our use of CSP, hence we want to establish a clear
    setting and a different versioining schema from the beginning. We will monitor closely the
    upstream repository and try to align on important changes but we reserve the right to
    diverge if needed.

